                            <comment id="16655323" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 18 Oct 2018 14:34:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user alamar opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5027&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5027&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9843&quot; title=&quot; IgniteClientReconnectCacheQueriesFailoverTest fails: grid loses type meta without losing data&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9843&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9843&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; If metadata is not available due to reconnect..,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &#8230;return reconnect future wrapped in CacheException.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite&lt;/a&gt; ignite-9843&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5027.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5027.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #5027&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit 5b657da798f8e4923f9b14f24b94bbeae0365d10&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Ilya Kasnacheev &amp;lt;ilya.kasnacheev@...&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2018-10-18T14:19:55Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9843&quot; title=&quot; IgniteClientReconnectCacheQueriesFailoverTest fails: grid loses type meta without losing data&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9843&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9843&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; If metadata is not available due to reconnect, return reconnect future wrapped in CacheException.&lt;/p&gt;

